Create a structured quiz on {topic}.

Student Level: {level}

Requirements:
- Create exactly {numberOfQuestions} multiple-choice questions.
- Provide a clear title, shortDescription, longDescription, topic, difficulty, category, and a list of instructions.
- Set durationMinutes, passingMarks, totalMarks, and the marks for every question consistently.
- Number questions starting from 1 and name the field questionText.
